[{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0010","text":"嗯——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0020","text":"──……哈啊……\n…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0030","text":"『大家，早上好』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0040","text":"『虽然是早间节目，\n　听说恋钟和结华大概8点左右出场』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0050","text":"『很遗憾，我这边看起来很难看到……\n　要是出发前能再宽裕一点就好了……！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0060","text":"……诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0070","text":"『那个节目，刚才是不是播过了？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0080","text":"『就是恋钟和三峰介绍便利小工具的那个』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0090","text":"“诶？”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0100","text":"啊——\n不对"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0110","text":"『抱歉，是梦』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0120","text":"『连梦里都在看那个节目』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0130","text":"“唷”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0140","text":"『看来你真的很期待那个节目呢』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0150","text":"“欸——”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0160","text":"『还不是因为恋钟昨天\n　拼命跟我们安利嘛—』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0170","text":"『是吗？\n　啊，我也好想在梦里看到啊』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0180","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0190","text":"……嘛，反正都醒了—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_03_0200","text":"那就看直播吧"}]
